         <editorialDecl><p>C. 70 instances where the app crit contains abbreviations and graphic oddities trying to capture what is in the MSS. Not easily represented and not worth adding at this stage. These are for the most part just listed as illegible gaps. Front and back matter removed as this was largely uncorrected and badly captured.</p></editorialDecl>
